program	float_integer_operand_mix.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	operator `+` requires both operands to have the same type, but the left is `Int` and the right is `Float`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: operator `+` requires both operands to have the same type, but the left is `Int` and the right is `Float`"
log	"  --> examples/float_integer_operand_mix.saw:23:7"
log	"     |"
log	" 23 |     a + f"
log	"     |       ^"
log	"   hint: `Float` and the integer types never convert implicitly — write a float literal (`1.0`), or convert the operand explicitly"
log	""
log	"error: function `mix` should return `Float` but body has no value"
log	"  --> examples/float_integer_operand_mix.saw:22:1"
log	"     |"
log	" 22 | func mix(a: Int, f: Float) -> Float {"
log	"     | ^"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
